{
  "title": "Reflex | Cluster autoscaler operations",
  "description": "Demand and ready capacity, pending pods, node groups and lifecycle, and guarded scaling recommendations. Select one simulation_run and its historical time range. SDK panels are scoped to the autoscaler.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "auto",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "defaults": [
        "local"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "application",
      "prefix": "service",
      "defaults": [
        "reflex"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "policy",
      "prefix": "policy",
      "defaults": [
        "jev"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "run",
      "prefix": "simulation_run",
      "defaults": [
        "*"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Cluster autoscaling\nSelect an environment, application, policy and **simulation run**, then the matching time range. Every autoscaler metric carries its run tag whenever `--datadog` export is on; run `*` combines runs, so select one run to read demand, capacity and node counts. A reset starts a new run.\nCPU and memory show **requests and reservations**, not measured usage. Pending pods fit no ready node. Durations and pending pod-seconds use simulated time; rates and bucket counts use wall time (aligned at 1\u00d7). Missing telemetry is not interpreted as no demand or spare capacity.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Outcomes \u2014 selected time range",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "show_title": true,
        "background_color": "blue",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "id": 2,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Scale-ups applied",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:autoscaler.decisions{$env AND $application AND $policy AND $run AND action:scale_up AND outcome:applied}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 3,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Removals applied",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:autoscaler.decisions{$env AND $application AND $policy AND $run AND action:remove AND outcome:applied}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 4,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Recommendations rejected",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:autoscaler.decisions{$env AND $application AND $policy AND $run AND outcome:rejected}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 5,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Nodes that became ready",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:autoscaler.node.events{$env AND $application AND $policy AND $run AND event:ready}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 6,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Provisioning failures",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:autoscaler.node.events{$env AND $application AND $policy AND $run AND event:failed}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 7,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Pending pod-seconds",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:autoscaler.pods.pending.time{$env AND $application AND $policy AND $run}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
